# pnpm's store links. Never tracked, and already excluded from the
# `invariants` task's declared inputs by the `**/node_modules/**` pattern the
# console's arrival put there — see plowshare-server/build.gradle.kts for why
# that exclusion cannot make the guard stale.
node_modules/

# Gradle's build directory for this module. Three things land here and none of
# them is tracked: the Vitest JUnit XML, the .d.ts files `tsc -b` emits so one
# project can reference another, and its .tsbuildinfo. The root .gitignore
# already covers `build/`; repeated here because a reader of this file should
# not have to go and check.
#
# There is deliberately NO `dist/` line, unlike the console's copy of this
# file. Nothing bundles this module — zero runtime dependencies, no Vite — so
# there is no output beside the sources to ignore, and a line pre-emptively
# ignoring one would be the first quiet step towards there being one.
build/
